          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 30 2023 17:47:39 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Stryker’s Chair and CEO Kevin Lobo discusses the value of a strong mission statement, and how it contributes to a feeling of purpose.</p>\n<p>&quot;We see a lot of people that come to work for Stryker because they are driven by the mission statement,&quot; says Chair and CEO Kevin Lobo. &quot;I think the world has changed where people really want to make a difference. They want to work for a company that's improving the world.&quot;</p>\n<p>At Stryker, we deliver on our mission by executing our strategy, and within that strategy, we embed responsible, sustainable practices in the way we do business. Learn how an engaged workforce helps advance our mission and our company in this interview.<br>\n<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 30 2023 17:47:51 GMT+0000",
